Output src/generated/format_json_jq.mp4
Require nvim

Hide
Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 20
Set Width 1200
Set Height 600
Set Padding 0
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set TypingSpeed 150ms
Type "nvim --clean src/generated/format_json_jq.json"
Enter
Show

Type ":"
Type "%"
Type "!"
Type "j"
Type "q"
Type " "
Type "."
Enter

Escape

Hide
Type ":w!"
Enter
Show

Sleep 2s